 "_operators_doc": "operators rows: [operator_id, symbol, canonical_name, evidence_channel, may_assert_action]. may_assert_action is False for EVERY modality operator (owner rule, N Hartman 2026-11-03): exterior senses (👀 👂👂 🙌 touch 👃 👅) are input data, like a robot's sensor stream; a modality operator is a sub-action that is part of a TOTE loop and never asserts the loop's action by itself. The action is carried by action_cell/action_lemma. Every loop needs >=1 modality operator, an actor, an action and a tool or object (nych3.tote_four_part)."
